      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROUGH BOY ROCKY (8) finished third (23.10) two back at Mt Gambier but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Can make amends. CATCHING (1) started big odds last time but hit the ground running with a slick early split, giving a sight but fading out of it to finish fifth (17.28) at this track over 300m. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. COSTLY HABITS (5) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (30.43) at Mt Gambier behind Zipping Keys in a TG1-4W. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Leading chance. TODD'S LUKA (7) can feature with the right run.",
